  "description": "The CB-V61 bag is a versatile carrying solution for portable 61-note keyboards like GO:KEYS 3, GO:KEYS 5, JUNO-D6, and other Roland models. Whether using the comfortable carrying handles or padded backpack straps, traveling to music sessions is easy with this quality bag.\n\nThe CB-V61 protects your keyboard at home and on the move. It features a durable polyester exterior, an adjustable internal securing strap, and three removable cushions that allow you to customize the fit for your instrument\u2019s dimensions.\n\nWith the CB-V61's large front pocket, you have a convenient home for stowing cables, AC cords, and other essential accessories. It\u2019s also the perfect size to carry the optional music rest for the Roland GO:KEYS 3 and GO:KEYS 5 models.\n\nCarry your keys in style and show off your favorite keyboard brands with three included key chains that feature Roland, JUNO, and GO:KEYS logos.\n\nCustomizable Protection\n\nLarge Storage Pocket\n\nThree Key Chains",
